  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support toUN Coherence Efforts in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to ensure that the necessary capacities and ressources are available to the UN Resident Coordinator&apos;s office and the UN Country Team to better implement the Ugandan UN Development Assistance Framework in support of national development priorities and the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
